ParentVault_initialize
  ├── when initialization succeeds
  │   ├── it should set parent vault state
  │   └── it should grant POLICY_ENGINE_MANAGER_ROLE
  ├── when treasury is the zero address
  │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAddress
  ├── when policy engine manager is the zero address
  │   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoZeroAddress
  └── when policy engine is the zero address
      └── it should revert with "Policy engine is zero address"
